-- Migration 040: 70 more real, local Georgia organizations, all distinct from
-- migrations 008, 036, 037, 038, and 039. Broad coverage across ~25 cities:
-- Atlanta metro (Marietta, Kennesaw, Smyrna, Roswell, Duluth, Decatur, Cumming,
-- Lawrenceville, Fayetteville, Forest Park, Peachtree City, Palmetto, Hoschton,
-- Woodstock, Ellijay), plus Savannah, Augusta, Columbus, Macon, Athens, Warner
-- Robins, Newnan, Tybee Island, and statewide. Each org was researched
-- individually and its website/volunteer page verified. Pure inserts with fixed
-- ids - safe to re-run, existing rows untouched.

insert into public.organizations
